 high-quality AA batteries, ready to deliver dependable performance right out of the box.<br></p><p><br></p><h4>Key Features:</h4><ul><li>Rechargeable AA Battery Pack – Includes 2 high-performance Ni-MH AA batteries</li><li>1000mAh Capacity – Provides steady and long-lasting power for daily-use devices</li><li>1.2V Output – Suitable for all standard AA battery-compatible electronics</li><li>Eco-Friendly – Reduces environmental waste by replacing disposable batteries</li><li>Up to 1000 Recharge Cycles – Cost-effective and reusable for years</li><li>No Memory Effect – Charge anytime without reducing battery life</li><li>Versatile Use – Ideal for remote controls, cameras, flashlights, toys, and more</li><li>Reliable Brand – Trusted Camelion quality for consistent performance</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/remax-aaa02-814mwh-usb-type-c-rechargeable-lithium-battery\">Remax AAA02 814mWh USB Type-C Rechargeable Lithium Battery</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-pri